// `nxeonUserId`. lib/fulfil-checkout.ts classifies a session without `nxeonUserId` as
// "unpaid" and does nothing, so the platform's wallet/order fulfilment can never mistake
// a Cyrus purchase for a wallet top-up (test/cyrus-tokens-stripe.test.ts pins this).
