// Per call: service token (Authorization: Bearer cyk_...), a fresh Ed25519 subject assertion for the account (sub = the
// stable account id, never an email; 60 s, single use), an Idempotency-Key on writes that stays the same across this
// client's retries, a timeout, and bounded retries with backoff on 429/502/503/504/network. Unused today (no caller).
